# Clear Zenith modular polar UV v08

Source layouts: ../ClearZenith_RadialPilot_v07/{A,B,C}_SoftBody.png.
45 modules: 14 individually painted large groups and 31 distant groups painted in three 4-by-4 contact sheets. Module positions are recorded in layout.json. Crowns face the polar center; undersides fade outward. Broad darker body shading is distinct from alpha coverage.

Generated images are 1254 square (the requested 3072 resolution was not returned). Distant sheet cells are approximately 313 square. Modules were placed on 6144-square working canvases and resampled to final 4096-square textures. Final resolution is not a claim of native 4K generated detail.

Engine packing: R grayscale shading; G density transfer sampled from existing Hero v04; B 4R(1-R) midtone weight; A generated coverage independent of luminance. Narrow nearest-color padding protects transparent edges. RGBA and coverage files preserve unpacked art for review.

Imported to /Game/RXSkySystem/Cubeless/PaintedCloud/v04/Altitude/Rejected as T_CloudLook_ClearZenith_A_v08, T_CloudLook_ClearZenith_B_v08 and T_CloudLook_ClearZenith_C_v08. Texture settings match RadialPilot_v15, including linear color, RGBA-preserving compression and clamp addressing. Current level assignments were not changed. Engine visual review remains pending; these are unapproved assets.

Validation.json records exact pixel equality between each packed PNG and its Unreal TGA export. Unreal_Import.json records settings and dependency query results. manifest.json records placements, image hashes and coverage metrics. A/B/C review images use opaque backgrounds and are not engine inputs.

## Image generation prompt

Paint a high-resolution production CLOUD MODULE from this reference crop, keeping exact normalized position, scale, footprint, orientation and all negative-space gaps. This is a modular asset, not a new composition. Match the approved grayscale painting: intricate bright inward crown details, softly faded lower-detail darker density body behind it, no outlined edge, no repetitive teeth, no new shapes. Preserve reference lighting direction exactly; do NOT turn the cloud upright. Repaint at high detail resolution (request 3072 square) without adding small-scale detail in the quiet body. REPLACE BLACK EMPTY SPACE WITH REAL TRANSPARENCY. Dense cloud interiors must remain opaque even when dark gray. Only existing soft outward underside dissolves with smoothly graded alpha, crown remains crisp, side fade restrained. Keep straight grayscale RGB values for painted shadows instead of converting dark shading into transparency. No black matte, no colored fringes, no checkerboard, no labels.

Single module addition: This is one isolated cloud bank/group; do not crop or enlarge relative to its square canvas.

Sheet addition: This is a 4 by 4 module contact sheet. Preserve EVERY occupied cell and blank cell, positions and exact orientations. Repaint each cloud separately within its cell; no joining, no rearrangement, no enlarging, no extra clouds.
